#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:19
#: 81925ced38044d978a0ccc7f6a68387f
msgid "DroneCAN is a lightweight protocol designed for reliable communication in aerospace and robotic applications via CAN bus. The DroneCAN network is a decentralized peer network, where each peer (node) has a unique numeric identifier - node ID and that is only one parameter needs to be set for basic setup."
msgstr ""

